      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "之後我再也沒有去，因為那天我從診療所出來時，聽到一位重病人在哼哼，他的家屬則在哭泣。",
      "output_sha256": "7b7afe531115912295d018fd3f0127e258c723cbc527a0273aa2204941090a4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.536635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0298832f53755a96b73d511b5ae4759f3a2b10960dda48b8624275fa39f7cc30"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7b7afe531115912295d018fd3f0127e258c723cbc527a0273aa2204941090a4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我以爲病人病到不可治的程度，“他們不給藥吃，說藥貴，讓自己去買，哪裏有錢買？”",
      "output_sha256": "ca4894c2a7328dc09494e26af30e6231f3033d622c29e72148bf1ecb87911d1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca4894c2a7328dc09494e26af30e6231f3033d622c29e72148bf1ecb87911d1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是這樣說向我的。",
      "output_sha256": "bdb988f9124f7c83d3011fab6e6bec3f81cdb659bf045e3235a878b73cc0a09d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "bdb988f9124f7c83d3011fab6e6bec3f81cdb659bf045e3235a878b73cc0a09d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "去了兩天診療所，等了幾個鐘頭。",
      "output_sha256": "acdcfd2b9906a1b5afc950131b3df4cf521730fe8bbd6056009bb3d2da37c364",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
